docs/decisions.md:101:| PAT-5/10/11, OWN-5/15 | Refutable destructuring uses `let … else`; rules explain its fallback and mutability. | OD52/85 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:102:| PAT-2/3/4/7/9, TYPE-5, OWN-15 | Guards affect matching, coverage, commitment, and moves. | OD55 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:103:| PAT-3/7, OWN-15, REF-9 rationale | Range patterns match integer intervals. | OD56/41 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:104:| TYPE-7/11, STMT-4/5, OWN-15;  | Struct update `..base` supplies fields, has evaluation order, and copies fields. | OD53 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:105:| TYPE-11/21/24, OWN-D1/15, REF-3/5, MOD-9;  | Newtypes exist, have representation rules, constructors, `.0`, casts, and imports. | OD54/123/155 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:106:| REF-D3, SCOPE-D1;  | Borrow blocks bind a region via `in R`. | OD57 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:107:| OWN-8 rationale; REF-5/12 rationale | Auto-borrowed receivers are ordinary supported places; elaboration builds implicit receiver borrows. | OD32 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:108:| MEM-4 accepted example; OWN-15 heap-field row | `h.f` works directly through `&Heap<S>`/`&mut Heap<S>`. | OD30/36 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. Exact heap-array view remains [undecided: see the target Core proposal](#core-heap-array-view). |
docs/decisions.md:109:| TRUST-13, TRUST-4 exception; accepted example  | Reference-to-pointer conversion is safe and needs neither trust nor `Unsafe`. | OD98 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:110:| MEM-9, ARITH-13 | Proven runtime violations are refused only outside trusted/`Unsafe` functions. | OD118 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:111:| CON-3 | Contracts read parameters and `result`. | OD143 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:112:| STMT-11 and execution prose; OWN-13 rationale | Remaining locals “are destroyed”; storage teardown versus `Destroy` remains open. | OD69 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:113:| OWN-17 | Deferred Copy results are implicitly dropped. | OD140; authority rule 9 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:114:| OWN-5; catalog | `discard` accepts any Copy value. | OD62 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:115:| REF-10 | An exclusive-reference binding may go unused. | OD62 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:116:| SYN-1 and introduction | The external EBNF governs acceptance exactly. | OD150/77 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:117:| SYN-6 | A char literal is any one character; non-ASCII behavior is left open. | OD137 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
docs/decisions.md:118:| TYPE-6 | Comparisons take numbers only; bool/char support is unresolved. | OD42 | Fixed in prose 2026-11-03. |
